], ["an", 279], ["operation", 359], ["that", 997], ["is", 1157], ["growing", 1277], ["in", 1769], ["Brazil", 1875], ["I", 2832], ["can", 2899], ["set", 3058], ["up", 3298], ["that", 3431], ["foundation", 3630], ["and", 4535], ["be", 4628], ["the", 4827], ["local", 4987], ["team's", 5372], ["finance", 5758], ["partner", 6210]], "audio/agriventus-01-a6.mp3|That's why I'm excited about building the finance function at Agriventus Brazil.": [["That's", 120], ["why", 279], ["I'm", 426], ["excited", 545], ["about", 1051], ["building", 1410], ["the", 1769], ["finance", 1862], ["function", 2420], ["at", 3045], ["Agriventus", 3245], ["Brazil", 3843]], "audio/agriventus-02-a1.mp3|You're the exclusive global distributor of SNAP's dust control and coating products, S P 50 C for grains and C 40 F for fertilizers.": [["You're", 106], ["the", 266], ["exclusive", 346], ["global", 1223], ["distributor", 1742], ["of", 2487], ["SNAP's", 2593], ["dust", 3218], ["control", 3524], ["and", 4255], ["coating", 4362], ["products", 4721], ["S", 5665], ["P", 5891], ["50", 6144], ["C", 6529], ["for", 6808], ["grains", 6995], ["and", 7819], ["C", 7979], ["40", 8245], ["F", 8684], ["for", 9056], ["fertilizers", 9202]], "audio/agriventus-02-a2.mp3|Brazil is one of the largest fertilizer markets in the world, so the local operation makes a lot of sense.": [["Brazil", 120], ["is", 678], ["one", 798], ["of", 971], ["the", 1037], ["largest", 1157], ["fertilizer", 1808], ["markets", 2460], ["in", 2926], ["the", 3005], ["world", 3098], ["so", 3923], ["the", 4056], ["local", 4176], ["operation", 4535], ["makes", 5279], ["a", 5532], ["lot", 5598], ["of", 5864], ["sense", 5957]], "audio/agriventus-02-a3.mp3|I'd like to hear how you see the Brazilian business growing.": [["I'd", 106], ["like", 226], ["to", 412], ["hear", 505], ["how", 745], ["you", 904], ["see", 1064], ["the", 1383], ["Brazilian", 1503], ["business", 2088], ["growing", 2487]], "audio/agriventus-03-a1.mp3|It combines what I know best: agribusiness from F M C, import operations from Glovis, and reporting to a foreign headquarters.": [["It", 106], ["combines", 213], ["what", 771], ["I", 931], ["know", 997], ["best", 1290], ["agribusiness", 2301], ["from", 3032], ["F", 3404], ["M", 3723], ["C", 3896], ["import", 4814], ["operations", 5199], ["from", 5838], ["Glovis", 6024], ["and", 6888], ["reporting", 7008], ["to", 7500], ["a", 7646], ["foreign", 7739], ["headquarters", 8098]], "audio/agriventus-03-a2.mp3|And I want a role where I build something, not just maintain it.": [["And", 106], ["I", 173], ["want", 239], ["a", 452], ["role", 505], ["where", 878], ["I", 1051], ["build", 1157], ["something", 1489], ["not", 2301], ["just", 2473], ["maintain", 2699], ["it", 3165]], "audio/agriventus-04-a1.mp3|First 30 days: understand the business, the cash position and what the external accountant delivers.": [["First", 186], ["30 days", 492], ["understand", 1649], ["the", 2221], ["business", 2301], ["the", 3085], ["cash", 3192], ["position", 3577], ["and", 4282], ["what", 4415], ["the", 4601], ["external", 4681], ["accountant", 5359], ["delivers", 5864]], "audio/agriventus-04-a2.mp3|Days 30 to 60: monthly close calendar, approval limits and bank reconciliations.": [["Days", 106], ["30", 452], ["to", 838], ["60", 957], ["monthly", 1928], ["close", 2340], ["calendar", 2699], ["approval", 3497], ["limits", 3976], ["and", 4588], ["bank", 4814], ["reconciliations", 5173]], "audio/agriventus-04-a3.mp3|Days 60 to 90: budget, cash forecast and a monthly reporting package for headquarters.": [["Days", 106], ["60", 426], ["to", 931], ["90", 1064], ["budget", 1928], ["cash", 2633], ["forecast", 2965], ["and", 3883], ["a", 3989], ["monthly", 4043], ["reporting", 4521], ["package", 5027], ["for", 5492], ["headquarters", 5665]], "audio/agriventus-05-a1.mp3|When we import from Argentina, we pay import duty, I P I, P I S, Cofins and I C M S, plus customs costs.": [["When", 120], ["we", 226], ["import", 346], ["from", 731], ["Argentina", 904], ["we", 1888], ["pay", 2048], ["import", 2340], ["duty", 2779], ["I", 3511], ["P", 3630], ["I", 3989], ["P", 4521], ["I", 4801], ["S", 5027], ["Cofins", 5705], ["and", 6476], ["I", 6662], ["C", 6795], ["M", 7101], ["S", 7301], ["plus", 7952], ["customs", 8245], ["costs", 8684]], "audio/agriventus-05-a2.mp3|Some of these generate tax credits, so the real cost is lower than the gross amount.": [["Some", 106], ["of", 306], ["these", 412], ["generate", 665], ["tax", 1184], ["credits", 1556], ["so", 2380], ["the", 2513], ["real", 2633], ["cost", 2899], ["is", 3457], ["lower", 3604], ["than", 4043], ["the", 4189], ["gross", 4282], ["amount", 4588]], "audio/agriventus-05-a3.mp3|Mercosur origin may reduce the import duty.": [["Mercosur", 106], ["origin", 745], ["may", 1476], ["reduce", 1676], ["the", 2301], ["import", 2500], ["duty", 3005]], "audio/agriventus-05-a4.mp3|I'd build a landed cost model so pricing reflects all of it.": [["I'd", 106], ["build", 319], ["a", 558], ["landed", 612], ["cost", 1144], ["model", 1543], ["so", 2088], ["pricing", 2340], ["reflects", 2859], ["all", 3351], ["of", 3630], ["it", 3737]], "audio/agriventus-06-a1.mp3|A rolling 13-week cash forecast, reviewed weekly.": [["A", 93], ["rolling", 160], ["13-week", 652], ["cash", 1569], ["forecast", 1915], ["reviewed", 2965], ["weekly", 3338]], "audio/agriventus-06-a2.mp3|For F X, I map our exposure, since we buy in dollars and sell in reais.": [["For", 146], ["F", 332], ["X", 505], ["I", 1210], ["map", 1263], ["our", 1596], ["exposure", 1769], ["since", 2633], ["we", 2846], ["buy", 2965], ["in", 3205], ["dollars", 3311], ["and", 3856], ["sell", 3989], ["in", 4402], ["reais", 4521]], "audio/agriventus-06-a3.mp3|Then I decide with you whether to hedge or price in dollars.": [["Then", 120], ["I", 239], ["decide", 319], ["with", 785], ["you", 944], ["whether", 1077], ["to", 1343], ["hedge", 1436], ["or", 2128], ["price", 2247], ["in", 2633], ["dollars", 2739]], "audio/agriventus-06-a4.mp3|In ag