ole", 1582], ["in", 1942], ["the", 2021], ["first", 2101], ["year", 2473]], "audio/agriventus-11-a3.mp3|And how big is the Brazilian operation today, and what are the growth plans?": [["And", 106], ["how", 199], ["big", 465], ["is", 864], ["the", 984], ["Brazilian", 1090], ["operation", 1636], ["today", 2234], ["and", 2926], ["what", 3045], ["are", 3165], ["the", 3218], ["growth", 3311], ["plans", 3644]], "audio/upwork-01-a1.mp3|Sure. I'm a licensed accountant from Brazil with about 17 years in corporate finance at multinational companies.": [["Sure", 106], ["I'm", 918], ["a", 1024], ["licensed", 1077], ["accountant", 1636], ["from", 2061], ["Brazil", 2261], ["with", 2899], ["about", 3058], ["17 years", 3351], ["in", 4375], ["corporate", 4521], ["finance", 4973], ["at", 5731], ["multinational", 5918], ["companies", 6715]], "audio/upwork-01-a2.mp3|For the last six years I was Finance & Controlling Manager at Glovis Brasil, a logistics company,": [["For", 133], ["the", 199], ["last", 293], ["six", 638], ["years", 864], ["I", 1184], ["was", 1250], ["Finance", 1423], ["&", 2141], ["Controlling", 2274], ["Manager", 2819], ["at", 3338], ["Glovis", 3457], ["Brasil", 3923], ["a", 4761], ["logistics", 4787], ["company", 5346]], "audio/upwork-01-a3.mp3|where I ran the monthly close, cash flow forecasting, budget versus actual by business unit, and internal controls.": [["where", 120], ["I", 239], ["ran", 359], ["the", 758], ["monthly", 851], ["close", 1343], ["cash", 2154], ["flow", 2487], ["forecasting", 2739], ["budget", 3803], ["versus", 4162], ["actual", 4521], ["by", 5040], ["business", 5213], ["unit", 5705], ["and", 6370], ["internal", 6449], ["controls", 6848]], "audio/upwork-01-a4.mp3|Before that I was a senior F P and A analyst at F M C and worked in planning and accounting at Ottobock.": [["Before", 120], ["that", 426], ["I", 558], ["was", 652], ["a", 838], ["senior", 918], ["F", 1463], ["P", 1676], ["and", 2128], ["A", 2287], ["analyst", 2487], ["at", 3058], ["F", 